status*	string
readOnly: true
Status of the benefit package. It can be:

ACTIVE: The benefit package is active.
AWAITING_AGENT_SIGNATURE: The benefit package has been created and is awaiting the signature of the agent.
AWAITING_START: The benefit package has been submitted and is awaiting its active_start_at date.
CANCELLED: The benefit package has been cancelled by the agent.
DRAFT: The benefit package has been created but not yet submited.
EXPIRED: The active_end_at date has finished, and the benefit package is no longer active.
N.B. The list of values is temporary and still needs to be validated / settled on MyDataAtlas before the release of the stable version.

